e8LcPbvGXrQQ7kNvwEO5xFM&_nc_oc=Ado7uZyJ-K2nabuSlBFe9lGRVhh2Pg_xe-ha3kcHYA1wHJbZVQhOgr2rpFQ--2Z2KrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyM6WJ36T5cA9uu2NXgoUTarFzogKlnEldtJGkqyNGMqw&oe=69CA8537"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kHfbUlecPEAQ7kNvwFSB6sj&_nc_oc=AdrlTq3uj17SHsuzGcXj6mGXfTBnOp7nh_NpcUhc-1papZ9gHatcnExeC3u15sJ1mcM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwYaQdlzFyFgjZEFOFksSk-NOXrAax8QFfTzvj3fQIH4A&oe=69CA86CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JVFfKYdF00EQ7kNvwE4_Xet&_nc_oc=AdriOtypZlQNJ46d83oLVP2f7wYkhVsdv5Pp4h-2I-zzh1SzaVGm9qTJB512K-4k11M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyzISPX8igYRKPXpDwu4jRfAkfO6TG2ZJRRmZMhVf4h6g&oe=69CA73EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=woteR_ChgQsQ7kNvwHcaYPI&_nc_oc=AdrPAuyxDXfAqjU1C6HZsugtD7Nhod5YPnarQH_LFKWIAJRiVKbZ9h7UkQgggSoSYPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afyo7t-XX5LzP1w-DhzmTgbXvUER0Wt1m9MT6x0v0fkZ_w&oe=69CA5D43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q3F-iAFxeXIQ7kNvwGYRdfX&_nc_oc=AdrzDQrHr0CQ8gLtPBqn0BaTKvUnOjWXFQIV8agYVwrMvoibKaTEm0p8sxC_QNQ7xP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyBKkgvmGbnf6waBE-RBXulK8KueN_4K1-kX4jmXNjDUA&oe=69CA5598"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lHh68NGI9VAQ7kNvwExFjWM&_nc_oc=Adr54gvf6oSPWs0rd9glUhM_j3P-0rEaW17Io1OYmbtcOvsmPJtkwzEfer55GfrraVA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz3uTCHsHozMBmIlP89TZqtYNcyCDDBfQ578a8MhjA1LA&oe=69CA68BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080